invalid.js:7:3 lint/nursery/noVueExposeAfterAwait ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × This expose() call comes after an await, so it runs too late.
  
